{"Title":"An Act relative to retirement buy back into the Massachusetts State Retirement system for Sherrie Stevens","BillNumber":"S1684","DocketNumber":"SD101","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AMG0","Name":"Anne M. Gobi","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AMG0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-10T15:31:22.903"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AMG0","Name":"Anne M. Gobi","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AMG0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-10T15:31:22.9033333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S1684/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Ms. Gobi, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 1684) of Anne M. Gobi for legislation relative to retirement buy back into the Massachusetts State Retirement system for Sherrie Stevens.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, to determine Sherrie Stevens’s retirement allowance pursuant to chapter 32 of the General Laws, the state retirement board shall credit Sherrie Stevens, an employee of the Westborough Public Schools district, with credible service for service she rendered to the Devereux School in Rutland during the period from April, 1986 through September, 2000. \r\n\tSECTION 2. Eligibility for this creditable service shall be conditioned upon payment by Sherrie Stevens to the state retirement board, in a single sum or installments, of an amount equal to the contributions she would have paid to the state retirement board if she had been an active member during the time period specified in section 1, at the contribution rate when she joined the system plus actuarial assumed interest. \r\n\tSECTION 3. This act shall take effect upon its passage.  \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}